3", "message": "Gerador de Gaussinas pelo m\u00e9todo da aceita\u00e7\u00e3o-rejei\u00e7\u00e3o", "created_at": "2024-10-26T07:19:08Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e58eed1bb4b0199b94f4de8c3e985122e7de0689", "message": "gerador de amostras da distribui\u00e7\u00e3o Poisson\n\nImplementado o m\u00e9todo de gera\u00e7\u00e3o de amostras para distribui\u00e7\u00f5es discretas. Em especial  algoritmo foi implementado para a distribui\u00e7\u00e3o Poisson at\u00e9 o momento. Outras distribui\u00e7\u00f5es ser\u00e3o exploradas futuramente.", "created_at": "2024-10-25T18:47:31Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b33d1f32b84ea1660fc746c84394edc848e35f8c", "message": "Geradores pelo m\u00e9todo da invers\u00e3o\n\nImplementados as principais fun\u00e7\u00f5es, incluindo a fun\u00e7\u00e3o para gera\u00e7\u00e3o de n\u00fameros aleat\u00f3rios das distribui\u00e7\u00f5es: Pareto, Exponencial e Kumaraswamy.", "created_at": "2024-10-24T08:46:27Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1c8f9de49e927e34cef59075cfb9ecf9db2194c7", "message": "Gerador das distribui\u00e7\u00f5es Qui-Quadrado e Cauchy", "created_at": "2024-10-21T18:31:23Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f8892bec7b36490e36112df48384f5f4a673ebab", "message": "Deixando opcional a fixa\u00e7\u00e3o da semente de gera\u00e7\u00e3o", "created_at": "2024-10-21T17:50:19Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c22d47078c34df7c7372a7786cf7853f65a66856", "message": "Adicionando argumento para fixar a semente de gera\u00e7\u00e3o", "created_at": "2024-10-21T16:59:51Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "35c33a1632522a09bc8a12fb3a319f25eb28b684", "message": "Resolvendo inconsist\u00eancias\n\nAs fun\u00e7\u00f5es de gera\u00e7\u00e3o de n\u00fameros pseudo aleat\u00f3rios de gaussianas estavam retornando dois valores quando o tamanho de amostra desejado era 1. Al\u00e9m disso tinha um problema na divis\u00e3o da amostra para calcular as transforma\u00e7\u00f5es dentro da fun\u00e7\u00e3o do m\u00e9todo de Box Muller.", "created_at": "2024-10-21T16:48:19Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cb1c49f0d8de253affb97db9350df8f70c11e0fe", "message": "M\u00e9todos de gera\u00e7\u00e3o de n\u00fameros gaussianos", "created_at": "2024-10-20T01:47:30Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "88dd646cb466fbc8b558038801cf7fdb9d5bd2e8", "message": "Geradores de n\u00fameros da U(0,1)", "created_at": "2024-10-20T00:52:11Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "94ad407db139c9ca110f17a4d5c98d0927b2c075", "message": "alguma att esquecida", "created_at": "2024-10-20T00:48:10Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "764ab1e987004a67681d2d6c3fd9c91b87a21e90", "message": "att", "created_at": "2024-07-11T17:45:34Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1182243f680db58b9e6d10f81fb9abe69e357b2e", "message": "Dados utilizados no trabalho", "created_at": "2024-07-11T05:33:06Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d28b3c0ca60a876fafd47a6f7a48b08ba2f3125b", "message": "C\u00f3digo de ajuste dos modelos", "created_at": "2024-07-11T05:32:56Z", "repo": "Atividades_aulas", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dae5a3d1f8015e21d0654af2989